      "content": "idk... i've tried talking to people and it just feels like more work. like i have to explain myself over and over just to get basic respect. it's just so heavy. sometimes i look at how much easier life would be if i just... didn't have to deal with any of this anymore. if i could just stop existing so the struggle stops. does that even make sense?",
