      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right—\"it gets better\" is a hollow promise when you can't see a path to it, and the future feels like a wall. But peace doesn't have to mean erasing yourself; it can mean finding a smaller, quieter version of life that's actually yours, not the one you perform for others. You don't have to solve all fifty years today—just the next hour, and then the one after that. You deserve to find out what that version of peace feels like, even if it's slow.",
